    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfad7e4226ce21ce415951cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那样的她因为身材高大，\n从出道前就备受瞩目……\n但要活用高大的体型，必须拥有强韧的体魄。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b46c903e99b36e72e47d2af546a735dd20acfc80359b3adecff3dae3ed7a0b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
