    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3eb80974cd80eb8421ed7dfa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以锻炼身体为中心的训练进行了一年。\n她的身体，也已经调整到\n可将她的力量发挥到极限的状态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e07ef703687e7baa320873e975514600d62e99fc12c6fc61f0eaa87c5e6d5f71",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1028/storytimeline_501028401.json",
      "json_path": [
