    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef9760448457962450df56e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后终于要正式参赛。\n我们将目标定在听说微光飞驹\n也会参加的“短途马锦标”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dff886f5e3b2825dd4b5fda5f32ceb664ef4474a4dddce11ca8f3161a51b63c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
