    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a33ca0d3e2a3a3815634500",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某天，我从菱曙那听说\n微光飞驹一副无精打采的样子。\n而原因似乎跟比赛有关。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eedbe021052f4f62ca444aa77fd9e9dae98ef5d1715b4e98836c00efdbe58180",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1028/storytimeline_501028402.json",
      "json_path": [
