    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d35548fe7f7f766ee9de3ed",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1028/storytimeline_501028402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06b87d9f1fd363952030124c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然遇到突发事件，但靠着微光飞驹的勇气\n与永不放弃的决心顺利解决。\n菱曙仿佛从她身上看见了耀眼的光辉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cb35744c828fc6a2a58b61a99386818d4618426a35a6c58c044f267846dd044",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1028/storytimeline_501028402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1907c1cc53a96deb1e5f2531",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1028/storytimeline_501028402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee5a3cde751e56bc8928122f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回程路上，当微光飞驹表示自己因为\n无法活用娇小身躯，使得比赛成绩不理想\n而烦恼时，菱曙鼓励她说──",
      "source_fingerprint": "263eed48c771dc38556f0c8c625cb9a4c6802b88be7b517a4e7a6d485ff7257e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1028/storytimeline_501028402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:904b5ac2fed81de4623a1435",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1028/storytimeline_501028402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6479b9c5afc7b3587b9be681",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“总是勇往直前的小光，已经是我的英雄了”。\n受到这句话的打气，\n微光飞驹终于再次振作起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99e605996927c72898def0e5a345f04d5372469f7509a81089d7324f86ade08a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1028/storytimeline_501028402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2137512ca6f3b1c18ceb9bb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "甜美又娇小的英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "e562d85b575a33bbf8b57a9eb8881a17551a1ac8c78ad7f9b28325ba5b9fc9c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1028/storytimeline_501028402.json",
      "json_path": [
