      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“安田纪念”结束后不久的某天，\n菱曙来找训练员商量，\n表示她的脚感觉不太对劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e8e4261940f9cd167302cebd1f25f642cc057a61da8e872183e1101dff7a8d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
