      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "诊断结果显示是累积了太多疲劳。\n由于一直承受巨大身躯及其造成的负荷，\n导致她的脚正逐渐接近极限。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc15a54055a8af263a7c9d9bbd59e0b954af4b075e95b873bff18048051b73d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
