    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d65beb90cc79facc10c91bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，菱曙没有立刻点头答应。\n因为大家期待的是\n“高大的菱曙的比赛”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3679927bdba005dd7d9c50f2682f9a2910a55321db1a139a4cff0ee70d4c13cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1028/storytimeline_501028403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7eae235d30c7745012c83f70",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1028/storytimeline_501028403.json",
      "json_path": [
