    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c414bd1b5ee138c50835f0b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想在三个月后的“短途马锦标”上，\n好好看过观众的反应再给出答案──\n这是菱曙现在的回答。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7033f3a4379c91f73a7861387e4c140ca8cfc12f35bca4b443f96ad943e38419",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1028/storytimeline_501028403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce93602444d13e210d0999fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今晚就细火慢炖吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4acfba73a2f2c8e1a2c8a76c51a203603c19626b1834a71b82b6a5bc7f6bd00",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1028/storytimeline_501028403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6dea568825ddc61de20b2ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱曙在寻找训练员的途中，\n遇到大树快车并听到她表示，\n菱曙的比赛只有菱曙才跑得出来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb9994d5b44a98fc5e7547550129243e60f1af8bd2ebd46c877407be611994f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1028/storytimeline_501028404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60ef6004dcf2b8de51c1b448",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱曙完全同意她的意见。\n于是菱曙带着训练员进了厨房……\n开始做起了相扑火锅！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6928a047c5d9ac9c24f9aa0f9251668b9863f68af5410a621c0e60b29daa1504",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1028/storytimeline_501028404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6003e88f992f4dc0959ebc9e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "并且，她说想继续以观众们所期待的\n“又大又有魄力”的菱曙\n去跑接下来的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4ed262664ca717d04adcf7db6c45b15537eeb7781dbf52eea52cceb865b5692",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1028/storytimeline_501028404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a65beab250bed5d31ca9e69",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使会因此缩短赛跑生涯也无妨，\n她想守住自己的“味道”。\n而她递出的相扑火锅，正是平时的那个“味道”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07fe708a924340849a33d0bb93f7f7fdc918da1f1f91c2f41a427abd265199b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1028/storytimeline_501028404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8cabb9b2d2f3f079fe0b4ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──那期待中的“味道”，\n隐藏着特别的美味。于是决定\n不改变赛跑风格，参加“英里CS”了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8c3f5656a6087eeabf0bae4cca4cf38802d5e25883be2f09e0d23b02dbf7280",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1028/storytimeline_501028404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
