      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在临近“英里CS”的记者会上，\n菱曙再次向大树快车宣战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7ae67101b598a19af26aca9652bf8e624976d92b9d40fc4d8979162cf1340c9",
